### ORDERS — List
GET {{base}}/api/orders?status=Created&page=1&pageSize=10&sort=-createdAt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ORDERS — Detail
GET {{base}}/api/orders/ORD-1001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ORDERS — Change Status (valid)
POST {{base}}/api/orders/ORD-1001/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "Paid",
  "reason": "test"
}

### ORDERS — Change Status (invalid → 409 expected)
POST {{base}}/api/orders/ORD-DELIVERED/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "Paid",
  "reason": "invalid-flow"
}

### PRODUCTS — List
GET {{base}}/api/products?search=knife&page=1&pageSize=10&sort=-createdAt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PRODUCTS — Create
POST {{base}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Ürün",
  "price": 199,
  "stock": 5,
  "active": true
}

### PRODUCTS — Update
PUT {{base}}/api/products/PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 12
}

### PRODUCTS — Delete
DELETE {{base}}/api/products/PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### USERS — List
GET {{base}}/api/users?role=Customer&q=@example.com&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### LOGS — List
GET {{base}}/api/logs?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### LOGS — Filtered (path + code)
GET {{base}}/api/logs?path=/api/orders&code=409&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
